WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.786
- God save the King!

00:00:02.786 --> 00:00:05.931
- [All] God save the King!

00:00:05.931 --> 00:00:08.848
(trumpets blaring)

00:00:27.397 --> 00:00:30.480
(upbeat band music)

00:00:36.358 --> 00:00:39.000
(crowd cheering)

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.890
- Very nice pageantry.

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:41.723
- It's great.

00:00:41.723 --> 00:00:44.273
And when the carriage went past, wow.

00:00:44.273 --> 00:00:46.940
(bells ringing)

00:00:55.676 --> 00:00:58.259
(mellow music)

00:00:59.114 --> 00:01:00.729
(trumpets blaring)

00:01:00.729 --> 00:01:03.229
(organ music)

00:01:08.654 --> 00:01:11.571
(trumpets blaring)

00:01:14.362 --> 00:01:16.779
(soft music)

00:01:18.404 --> 00:01:21.487
(indistinct chatter)

00:01:26.243 --> 00:01:29.160
(trumpets blaring)

00:01:30.205 --> 00:01:32.788
(bright music)

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:40.124
- I come not to be served, but to serve.

00:01:40.124 --> 00:01:43.207
(lighthearted music)

00:01:59.746 --> 00:02:03.913
(men singing in foreign language)

00:02:06.226 --> 00:02:10.976
- Receive this orb, receive
this ring, receive this glove

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:15.533
that you may hold authority
with gentleness and grace.

00:02:37.577 --> 00:02:40.103
(organ music)

00:02:40.103 --> 00:02:45.103
♪ God save our gracious king ♪

00:02:45.595 --> 00:02:50.595
♪ Long live our noble king ♪

00:02:51.552 --> 00:02:54.552
♪ God save the king ♪

00:02:58.111 --> 00:03:01.028
(canyons blasting)

00:03:06.296 --> 00:03:11.296
(officers shouting)
(canyon blasting)

00:03:12.608 --> 00:03:15.275
(bells ringing)

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:21.830
(upbeat band music)

00:03:25.686 --> 00:03:28.686
(lively band music)

00:03:30.481 --> 00:03:33.231
(crowd cheering)

00:03:36.543 --> 00:03:38.034
- [Protesters] Not my king!

00:03:38.034 --> 00:03:40.685
Not my king!

00:03:45.335 --> 00:03:48.835
- His Majesty's Armed Forces royal salute!

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:52.323
Present arms!

00:03:54.316 --> 00:03:57.429
(armed forces marching)

00:03:57.429 --> 00:03:58.262
Hip hip!

00:03:58.262 --> 00:04:00.481
- [Armed Forces] Hooray!

00:04:00.481 --> 00:04:03.231
(crowd cheering)

00:04:22.507 --> 00:04:25.424
(planes whooshing)

